===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|taken}}, {{m|enm|takenn}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tacen}}, {{m|ang|*ġetacen}}, from {{der|en|non|tekinn}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*tēkanaz}}, past participle of {{der|en|gem-pro|*tēkaną|t=to take; grasp; touch}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|takin}}, {{m|sco|tane}}, {{cog|da|tagen}}, {{cog|sv|tagen}}, {{cog|is|tekin}}.

Morphologically {{suffix|en|take|n<id:past participle>}}.

