===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# [[infatuated|Infatuated]]; [[fond]] of or [[attracted]] to.
#: {{ux|en|He was very '''taken''' with the girl, I hear.}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} In a serious romantic [[relationship]].
#: {{ux|en|I can't ask her out, she's '''taken'''.}}

